"Tailor Environment is a popular, must-choose C-rank Rabbit skill."
"It gives a knack for arranging possessions so that they suit their owner."
"At Level Two the knack becomes a strong knack; nothing is posted online beyond that."
"Its foundational supplements are small: dexterity, processing and strength."
"Its C-rank traits work only during use: steadier movement, muffled sound, or Rose Rabbit."
"Users ask questions first to establish ownership before arranging."
"Manon was among the first to pick it, about thirty years ago."
"An Indian Avowed who picked it later became a successful TV personality."
"It is popular among C-ranks; a summons for it may be arranging a desk for 45 minutes."
